✅ ASSIGNMENT 2: IMAGE EDITING SKILLS PROGRAM
================================================================================

TASK: Create program displaying image editing skills using OpenCV-Python
STATUS: ✅ COMPLETE

Reference Documentation: https://docs.opencv.org/5.0/
Framework: OpenCV 4.8.1.78 + Python

9 Image Editing Skills Demonstrated:

1. ✅ Image Resizing & Interpolation
   - Linear interpolation (INTER_LINEAR)
   - Cubic interpolation (INTER_CUBIC)
   - Proper upsampling and downsampling techniques

2. ✅ Color Space Conversion
   - BGR to Grayscale conversion
   - BGR to HSV (Hue, Saturation, Value) conversion
   - Channel separation and analysis

3. ✅ Blur & Smoothing Filters
   - Gaussian Blur: General noise reduction (15×15 kernel)
   - Median Blur: Salt-and-pepper noise removal
   - Bilateral Filter: Edge-preserving smoothing

4. ✅ Edge Detection
   - Sobel Operator: X and Y directional gradients
   - Canny Edge Detection: Multi-stage with hysteresis
   - Laplacian: Second derivative edge detection

5. ✅ Morphological Operations
   - Erosion: Shrink white/foreground regions
   - Dilation: Expand white/foreground regions
   - Opening: Erosion → Dilation (remove small noise)
   - Closing: Dilation → Erosion (fill small holes)

6. ✅ Contrast & Brightness Adjustment
   - Brightness offset (+30 pixel values)
   - Contrast scaling (1.5x multiplication)
   - Histogram equalization for distribution improvement

7. ✅ Thresholding Techniques
   - Binary thresholding (threshold = 127)
   - Binary inverse thresholding
   - Truncation thresholding
   - Adaptive thresholding (ADAPTIVE_THRESH_GAUSSIAN_C)

8. ✅ Geometric Transformations
   - Image rotation (30° counter-clockwise)
   - Affine transformation (preserves parallel lines)
   - Perspective transformation (3D-like effects)

9. ✅ Custom Kernel Filters
   - Sharpening kernel: 3×3 enhancement filter
   - Emboss kernel: 3D relief effect filter
   - Laplacian edge kernel: Edge emphasis

